      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lã. Quando a eletricidade estática se acumula no corpo de Mareep, sua lã dobra de volume, e tocá-la provoca um choque. Ela cresce continuamente. Durante o verão, cai por completo, mas volta a crescer em apenas uma semana.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mareep pode evoluir para Flaaffy no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Cotton Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Power Gem</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Cotton Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Dazzling Gleam, Signal Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Light Screen, Thunder</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Agility, Attract, Body Slam, Charge, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Dazzling Gleam, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Echoed Voice, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Frustration, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Magnet Rise, Power Gem, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>After You, Agility, Body Slam, Charge, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electroweb, Flatter, Iron Tail, Odor Sleuth, Sand Attack, Screech, Take Down</p>",
